  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nImporting browser bookmarks onto homarr.\r\nImporting from oldmarr is all nice and good, but for new users looking to import the links they've been saving as bookmark until then, it would be nice to support importing links directly onto apps and exporting as normalized bookmark format too.\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like to see\n\nImport/export buttons on apps management page.\r\nSupport for HTML bookmark files both ways.\n\n### Additional information\n\nHarder part might be to retrieve an image/icon/logo for each link.",
